  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 808.02 Pre-Requisites for Landfill Reclamation",
  "priorExpiration": "1997-10-29",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 808.02 Pre-Requisites for Landfill Reclamation.\n\n(a) Prior to conducting landfill reclamation activities, the permittee shall:\n\n(1) Obtain approval of a feasibility study scope-of-work meeting the requirements in Env-Sw 808.03(b) pursuant to the standard permit process in Env-Sw 314 or the permit modification process in Env-Sw 315;\n\n(2) Submit a report meeting the requirements of Env-Sw 808.03(c) to the department documenting the results of the feasibility study;\n\n(3) Obtain approval of a landfill reclamation work plan meeting the requirements of Env-Sw 808.04 pursuant to the permit modification process in Env-Sw 315; and\n\n(4) After complying with (1) through (3) above, receive approval from the department to commence reclamation activities.\n\nSource. #5172, eff 7-1-91; amd by #5297, eff 12-24-91; ss by #6535, INTERIM, eff 7-1-97, EXPIRES: 10-29-97; ss by #6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 800); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2508.02); ss by #10597, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14156, eff 12-21-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw800.html"
